<title>USA: Shopco Laurel to be delisted from AMEX.</title>
<headline>Shopco Laurel to be delisted from AMEX.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shopco Laurel Centre LP said it has been informed that the American Stock Exchange intends to remove Shopco's units from listing and registration because Shopco no longer meets listing requirements.</p>
<p>The company said it has met with representatives of the stock exchange to discuss continued listing possibilities, but has not elected to appeal the exchange's determination.</p>
<p>Shopco's units are now trading on the NASD's over-the-counter bulletin board under the symbol &quot;LSCZZ&quot;.</p>
</text>
